+# In-memory task service
+
+`TaskService` creates tasks in memory and notifies registered callbacks when a
+task is marked done. A callback receives the completed `Task` object.
+
+```python
+from task_service import TaskService
+
+service = TaskService()
+service.add_completion_listener(lambda task: print(f"Completed: {task.title}"))
+task = service.create_task("Prepare release")
+service.mark_done(task.id)
+```
+
+Run the main-path checks with:
+
+```sh
+python -m unittest -v
+```
